An airframe company that's pioneering the commercial flight industry. Run by a fortune dragon, Hildebrandt.

The company was first to market with commercial airlines and has kept that market, so that any other company wanting a commercial line buys Hildebrandt's airplanes. Along with [[Org/General Thematics/index|General Thematics]] it is pulling back from the contracts it holds with [[Org/Belvedere/index|Belvedere]] and the [[People/Qureshi|Qureshi]] family, saying only that it means to focus its energies elsewhere. The Qureshi barristers have time to lean on only one of the two.

[[Org/Yamamoto Aerospace|Yamamoto Aerospace]] is a competitor. It held one of the twenty [[Phenomena/Keystone|keystones]] until its compound was broken into and the stone taken, and hired mercenaries to take another from travelers on the road out of [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/index|Hallia]].

Hildebrandt holds berth 6 aboard the [[Org/The Harlequins/Providence|Providence]] at [[Geography/Calaria/Ragged Roost|Ragged Roost]], the first of the pilgrims to board, with two heavy armored cars tied together on a single [[Phenomena/Keystone|keystone]].
